 "description": "<p>A maid set cut for plus sizing rather than adapted to it: lace over a M and L run, with M covering 40-55 kg and L covering 55-70 kg. The collar-and-dress pairing keeps the costume readable at any size.</p>\n<p>Lace is the right fabric here - it stretches where it needs to and reads as deliberate design rather than compromise. The collar piece anchors the maid theme, and the dress falls straight from the bust, which is the most forgiving cut in costume construction.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: lace</li>\n<li>Includes: collar, dress</li>\n<li>Style: maid, plus-size friendly</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-55 kg), L (55-70 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose by weight band. The 70 kg top of the L range is a real fit, not an optimistic label.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Plus-size lace maid set with collar and dress in M for 40-55 kg and L for 55-70 kg, as pictured.</p>\n",
